  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Hair Thinning</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A super easy-to-use micro triangle pencil with a thicker side to fill in sparseness, a thinner point for shape and definition, and natural color that stays put. <br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Castor Oil: Nourishes hair so brows appear naturally lush, strong, and shiny.<br>- Panthenol Pro Vitamin B5: Revives brows. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This soft wax-based pencil effortlessly creates desired brow shape and thickness. The clean, vegan formula gives rich color payoff on the first stroke: pigment lasts all day with no smudging, fading, or transfer. Castor oil nourishes and protects, supporting overall brow health.<br><br><b>Clinical Resu</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the thin tip of the triangle to shape and define.<br>-Use the thicker side to fill in more sparse areas.  <br>-Brush through with spoolie to wear it how you feel it. <br>-Hot tip: Follow with Brow Pop Nano to add detail and dimension. Layer Air Brow Tinted gel and/or Air Brow Clear gel over pencil for the full Kosas brow look&mdash;peak tint, volume, and hold (all sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Castor Oil: Nourishes hair so brows appear naturally lush, strong, and shiny.<br>-Panthenol Pro Vitamin B5: Helps revive brows.<br><br>Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Mica, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Panthenol, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Tocopherol [+/-: Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)].<br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
